00,"sport":"ppg","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":40},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":60}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_20","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le rythme doit être confortable. Adapte ton allure à la forme du jour pour que le ressenti de la séance reste vraiment facile.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Que tu le ressentes ou pas, ces semaines de récupération ou d'assimilation sont plus que nécessaires. Elles aident ton corps à bien encaisser les semaines plus intenses et te permettent ensuite de repartir du bon pied, sans risque de blessure, ce qui doit être ta priorité numéro un en tant que coureur ! (car un coureur blessé progresse toujours moins qu'un coureur qui en fait un peu moins mais qui est régulier !)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_20","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":323,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1795392000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1200},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":323}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_20+3LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Quelques lignes droites en plus du traditionnel footing. De quoi te faire plaisir car il n'y a aucun objectif d'allure, juste de sentir que ton corps se libère et te permet d'accélérer progressivement de ligne droite en ligne droite !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_17","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":323,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":17,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":210,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":336,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1795392000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1200},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1020,"pace":{"value":323}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":210}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":336}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":210}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":336}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":210}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":336}}]},{"_t":"SmartPPGSessionWithStats","name":"PERF - MID - AUTRE - SEMAINE 4 SEANCE 2","description":"Séance en 3 blocs. Les deux premiers blocs sont composés de 3 séries de 2 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le troisième bloc est composé de 2 séries de 2x2 exercices différents alternés, enchainés sans pause. Prend 1'  de récupération entre les séries des bloc 1 et 2, et 2' entre les séries du bloc 3. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"Les débuts peuvent être durs, mais avec chaque séance, les exercices deviendront plus naturels, tu auras moins de courbatures (oui je sais) et tu ressentiras les bénéfices sur ta course et ta santé. C'est pour ça qu'il vaut mieux commencer doucement et tenir dans la durée que partir sur les chapeaux de roues et lâcher l'affaire.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exe