R","duration":120,"pace":{"value":335}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":600,"pace":{"value":323}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_20+3LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Le classique footing, celui où l'objectif est le relâchement et d'essayer d'avoir une technique efficace !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_17","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":323,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":17,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":208,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":335,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1799020800000,"status":"todo","sta